      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moscow_Mills%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Old Rock House, a historic home in Moscow Mills, earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 1972.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moscow_Mills%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1909 and 1919 give a detailed look at Moscow Mills’ downtown layout, businesses, and schools.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
